                "title": "36 Inch Handicap Safety Grab Bar",
                "description": "EZGrab GB36-1.5-KSS knurled grab bars. 36 inches long x 1-1/2 inches diameter anti-slip grip safety grab bar made from 18 gauge stainless steel. The knurled finish grab rail allows for better grip in all applications including wet/slippery environments. Fully ADA and Handicap compliant. Designed to exceed 250 lbs of load force when properly installed. Satin stainless steel finish.",
